<p><span style="font-size:16px;">Hi&nbsp;{{{Recipient.FirstName}}},<br /> <br /> I enjoyed our intro call and I look forward to talking further and potentially working together to build your portfolio.<br /> <br /> As promised, attached you will find example purchase contracts for TN &amp; TX, along with example leases, and a copy of our property mgmt agreement.<br /> <br /> I'll go ahead and tell you that I absolutely ABHORE the entire last page of the&nbsp;PMA, and several of those items I can easily have deleted from your agreement. Let's discuss that more on our next call.<br /> <br /> Lastly, </span><a href="https://www.auction.com/blog/5-landlord-friendly-states-in-2019/"><span style="font-size:16px;">here is one link </span></a> <span style="font-size:16px;">I found with a quick google search yesterday for you that explains why TX/TN are considered to be very landlord friendly.<br /> <br /> Also, </span><a href="https://smarterlandlording.com/the-one-clause-every-lease-in-tennessee-should-have/"><span style="font-size:16px;">here is a link</span></a> <span style="font-size:16px;"> that talks about the ability we have in TN to evict very quickly compared to other states.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Thanks,</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <a href="https://my-schedule.timetrade.com/app/td-1259187/workflows/rzlm2/schedule/availability?wfsid=16a5bde1-baba97f6-16a5be04-baba97f6-00000007-1s19g530acl5j8g9e2faj934keo7bi8u&amp;view=full&amp;fs=1"><img height="287" src="https://docs.google.com/uc?export=download&amp;id=1nGEH5IZsXxv52rNbVJepefIlS1odDllU&amp;revid=0B6FqHnQBLWozakhvQ3dEdmVmSzd4aTl0TVU3cytoaEplYkZrPQ" width="420" /></a></p>